# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# The derivative of the energy in the tunable parameters
# (D[tunable-gradient], docs/python-gradient.md) on the GPU, in double and
# mixed precision: the checks of python-tunable-gradient.test.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide terms GPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TERMS -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide terms GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TERMS -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide tails GPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TAILS -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide tails GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TAILS -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide lj GPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LJ -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide lj GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LJ -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: the term over tuples against NumPy
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: against central differences of the energy
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: the energy less the reported one
# TERMS: [[MODE]]: 12 steps through the derivative equal those without it to the bit: True
# TERMS: terms passed
# TAILS: [[MODE]]: dU/dc
# TAILS: [[MODE]]: against central differences of the energy
# TAILS: [[MODE]]: without the correction
# TAILS: tails passed
# LJ: [[MODE]]: the dipeptide, per-type and pair sigma and epsilon against central differences of the energy
# LJ: [[MODE]]: propane and water, per-type and pair sigma and epsilon with a pair set apart
# LJ: [[MODE]]: propane and water against central differences of the energy
# LJ: lj passed
